    <h3>How covariates enter: NHITSx and LightGBMx</h3>
    <div class="ctrl"><label>Put a promotion in horizon week <input type="range" id="cvW" min="0" max="14" value="0"></label><div class="seg" id="cvModel"><button aria-pressed="true" data-v="nhitsx">NHITSx ({pct(lift.NHITSx)})</button><button aria-pressed="false" data-v="lgbx">LightGBMx ({pct(lift.LightGBMx)})</button></div></div>
